# Git LFS
#
# No data files are stored in this repository (the processed data are on
# Zenodo, DOI 10.5281/zenodo.24470811, and .gitignore excludes them once
# restored). Any *.parquet added later goes to LFS rather than plain git.
*.parquet filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text

# Treat saved model weights and arrays as binary so git never tries to diff or
# line-ending-convert them.
*.npy binary
*.pt  binary
*.gz  binary
*.RCC binary
